(110, '2027-02-09', 3, 16, 'zkML flagship — KudiSense private credit-scoring circuit', 'Compile the circuit using EZKL. Debug any unsupported ONNX operators by adjusting the PyTorch model architecture and re-exporting. *(Resource: [EZKL Supported Operations](https://docs.ezkl.xyz/supported_ops/))*', 'Daily DSAR rep: Merkle proof edge cases — non-power-of-2 leaf counts, rejecting a malicious/forged proof.'),
